{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/凛耀•飞星护阵","pageid":9051,"revid":22162,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%9E%E6%98%9F%E6%8A%A4%E9%98%B5&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%9E%E6%98%9F%E6%8A%A4%E9%98%B5&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%9E%E6%98%9F%E6%8A%A4%E9%98%B5&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>凛耀•飞星护阵</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.87.9B.E8.80.80.E2.80.A2.E9.A3.9E.E6.98.9F.E6.8A.A4.E9.98.B5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"凛耀•飞星护阵\"><b>凛耀•飞星护阵</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 凛耀•飞星护阵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0c/axggbxj3kvlz05l6ce22pbkxefe6f19.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%9E%E6%98%9F%E6%8A%A4%E9%98%B5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0c/axggbxj3kvlz05l6ce22pbkxefe6f19.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%9E%E6%98%9F%E6%8A%A4%E9%98%B5.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0c/axggbxj3kvlz05l6ce22pbkxefe6f19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凛耀•飞星护阵\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）瞬移至指定地形格，瞬移后对相邻敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>范围伤害，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"全局援护3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">全局援护3</font></span></span>]，持续1回合。<br />✦可对射程外，任意友军范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>圈内地点释放（每超出<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格，冷却回合加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>）。<br />✦释放后，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合；每拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]，额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">10</font>点（每回合最多1次）；获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]后，若其层数不低于<font color=\"#58cb48\">20</font>层，则获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"群星护阵\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">群星护阵</font></span></span>]，持续至下次行动开始。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/79/i29swk39niyqh5cmz3afznuuaebly4e.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/79/i29swk39niyqh5cmz3afznuuaebly4e.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%84%E5%A5%A5%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/狄奥娜\"><img alt=\"头像 狄奥娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/69/3k01hs8h1x90i6tejnl6yrh46nftbx7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">狄奥娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022004643\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.468 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.653 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10062/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 174223/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20585/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTrans